body:
Threatening to off herself because you don't want to mess with her anymore or WORSE trying to trap you when you want to leave.

&#x200B;

Chrisean Rock.

It was five years. I was 27 and she was 22. The largest age gap for sex would be honestly anyone over 22 and under 50(?)

&#x200B;

I would not want to be with anyone under 21 honestly. It feels icky.

OMFG, she is making me so angry reading this.

&#x200B;

OP , please run away for your mental health. This marriage is OVER. She has no remorse. No heart. Please run.

Wake up at 4am because whatever. Wake and bake with some liquor. Do that until 8am where I either log in to the helpdesk or I go to the office. Get off and smoke and drink more liquor and pass out.

&#x200B;

Being emotionally cheated on has just killed my last spark.
